{
  "id": 275535456,
  "slug": "um9srmsvawa6kz1f",
  "title": "DAG 观测与大数据性能诊断",
  "book_id": 78815357,
  "format": "lake",
  "status": 1,
  "word_count": 1103,
  "created_at": "2026-06-28T11:51:41.000Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-07-20T08:22:52.000Z",
  "published_at": "2026-07-20T08:22:52.000Z",
  "content_updated_at": "2026-07-20T08:22:52.000Z",
  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"V9C9N\" id=\"V9C9N\"><span data-lake-id=\"u452bc8da\" id=\"u452bc8da\">DAG 观测与大数据性能诊断</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"a06Ra\" id=\"a06Ra\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2baea08e\" id=\"u2baea08e\">1. 要解决的问题</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u339c4d91\" id=\"u339c4d91\"><span data-lake-id=\"u489fe20a\" id=\"u489fe20a\">Spark History Server 面向人工查看，Agent 则需要结构化事实。原始 Event Log 是逐事件 JSONL，Stage 完成信息和 Task 指标分散在不同记录中；如果直接把整份日志交给模型，不仅成本高，也容易出现没有证据的诊断。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua93881b4\" id=\"ua93881b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf770db28\" id=\"uf770db28\">本实现先把事件归一为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u6ff74d37\" id=\"u6ff74d37\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd3ce293\" id=\"ucd3ce293\">DagObservation</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7ee0579c\" id=\"u7ee0579c\">，再用确定性规则生成带 evidence、impact、priority 和 action 的诊断。LLM 可以在上层总结，但不负责编造指标。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"Jq9j8\" id=\"Jq9j8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u17ad4f8e\" id=\"u17ad4f8e\">2. 核心数据模型</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"VswmC\" id=\"VswmC\"><code data-lake-id=\"uee1a6b2f\" id=\"uee1a6b2f\"><span data-lake-id=\"udce1fd03\" id=\"udce1fd03\">StageMetric</span></code></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u4e27094a\" id=\"u4e27094a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2ef8f5c6\" id=\"u2ef8f5c6\">每个 Stage 聚合：</span></p><ul list=\"u90c01f91\"><li fid=\"ub29e4daf\" data-lake-id=\"u960ffe02\" id=\"u960ffe02\"><code data-lake-id=\"u99b90555\" id=\"u99b90555\"><span data-lake-id=\"u634e0601\" id=\"u634e0601\">stage_id</span></code></li><li fid=\"ub29e4daf\" data-lake-id=\"ua9817469\" id=\"ua9817469\"><code data-lake-id=\"u2305a0e2\" id=\"u2305a0e2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc505ef5e\" id=\"uc505ef5e\">task_count</span></code></li><li fid=\"ub29e4daf\" data-lake-id=\"ub3031c91\" id=\"ub3031c91\"><code data-lake-id=\"ua49cdd95\" id=\"ua49cdd95\"><span data-lake-id=\"u364f54fe\" id=\"u364f54fe\">duration_ms</span></code></li><li fid=\"ub29e4daf\" data-lake-id=\"u2aa6b0be\" id=\"u2aa6b0be\"><code data-lake-id=\"uac142503\" id=\"uac142503\"><span data-lake-id=\"u15b701f9\" id=\"u15b701f9\">shuffle_read_bytes</span></code></li><li fid=\"ub29e4daf\" data-lake-id=\"u1f4ecf1c\" id=\"u1f4ecf1c\"><code data-lake-id=\"u45b9cc08\" id=\"u45b9cc08\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41c6029d\" id=\"u41c6029d\">shuffle_write_bytes</span></code></li><li fid=\"ub29e4daf\" data-lake-id=\"uc7eecece\" id=\"uc7eecece\"><code data-lake-id=\"u639606d0\" id=\"u639606d0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua22b18df\" id=\"ua22b18df\">input_rows</span></code></li><li fid=\"ub29e4daf\" data-lake-id=\"u2066add8\" id=\"u2066add8\"><code data-lake-id=\"u509f1577\" id=\"u509f1577\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf193f1a2\" id=\"uf193f1a2\">spilled_bytes</span></code></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"kdHYh\" id=\"kdHYh\"><code data-lake-id=\"ub8b2292d\" id=\"ub8b2292d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u636821d8\" id=\"u636821d8\">DagObservation</span></code></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uea73f24e\" id=\"uea73f24e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u91288010\" id=\"u91288010\">保存 application id、Stage 列表、错误日志和数据来源 metadata，并提供总 Shuffle 等派生信息。诊断引擎依赖该领域对象，不依赖 Spark 原始 JSON 字段。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"Hltx3\" id=\"Hltx3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u77b19816\" id=\"u77b19816\">3. 从 Event Log 到诊断 artifact</span></h2><card type=\"block\" name=\"diagram\" value=\"data:%7B%22type%22%3A%22mermaid%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22flowchart%20LR%5Cn%20%20%20%20Event%5B%5C%22Spark%20Event%20Log%20JSONL%5C%22%5D%20--%3E%20Parser%5B%5C%22EventLogParser.parse()%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Parser%20--%3E%20App%5B%5C%22ApplicationStart%20%E2%86%92%20app_id%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Parser%20--%3E%20Stage%5B%5C%22StageCompleted%20%E2%86%92%20task_count%2Fduration%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Parser%20--%3E%20Task%5B%5C%22TaskEnd%20%E2%86%92%20shuffle%2Finput%2Fspill%20%E7%B4%AF%E5%8A%A0%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Parser%20--%3E%20Error%5B%5C%22Error%20event%20%E2%86%92%20logs%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20App%20--%3E%20Obs%5B%5C%22DagObservation%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Stage%20--%3E%20Obs%5Cn%20%20%20%20Task%20--%3E%20Obs%5Cn%20%20%20%20Error%20--%3E%20Obs%5Cn%20%20%20%20Obs%20--%3E%20Engine%5B%5C%22DagDiagnosisEngine.diagnose()%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Request%5B%5C%22user_request%20%E8%AF%AD%E4%B9%89%5C%22%5D%20--%3E%20Engine%5Cn%20%20%20%20Engine%20--%3E%20Diagnosis%5B%5C%22bottlenecks%20%2B%20suggestions%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Diagnosis%20--%3E%20Artifact%5B%5C%2207_dag_diagnosis.json%5C%22%5D%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__mermaid_v3%2F252ebbb138d1ee426289853044144607.svg%22%2C%22collapse%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22aV4RN%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"pg89d\" id=\"pg89d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufa06ded1\" id=\"ufa06ded1\">4. Event Log 解析细节</span></h2><card type=\"block\" name=\"diagram\" value=\"data:%7B%22type%22%3A%22mermaid%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sequenceDiagram%5Cn%20%20%20%20autonumber%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20Caller%20as%20DagObserver%2FSparkToolExecutor%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20Parser%20as%20EventLogParser%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20File%20as%20JSONL%20%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20Stages%20as%20dict%5Bstage_id%2C%20StageMetric%5D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20Caller-%3E%3EParser%3A%20parse(path)%5Cn%20%20%20%20Parser-%3E%3EFile%3A%20%E9%80%90%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%EF%BC%8Cencoding%3Dutf-8%2C%20errors%3Dreplace%5Cn%20%20%20%20loop%20%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%80%E8%A1%8C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20File--%3E%3EParser%3A%20line%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20alt%20%E7%A9%BA%E8%A1%8C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Parser-%3E%3EParser%3A%20continue%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20else%20JSON%20%E6%8D%9F%E5%9D%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Parser-%3E%3EParser%3A%20%E6%8D%95%E8%8E%B7%20JSONDecodeError%20%E5%B9%B6%20continue%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20else%20ApplicationStart%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Parser-%3E%3EParser%3A%20%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%20App%20ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20else%20StageCompleted%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Parser-%3E%3EStages%3A%20setdefault(stage_id)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Parser-%3E%3EStages%3A%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%20task_count%20%E5%92%8C%20duration_ms%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20else%20TaskEnd%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Parser-%3E%3EStages%3A%20setdefault(stage_id)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Parser-%3E%3EStages%3A%20%E7%B4%AF%E5%8A%A0%20shuffle%2Finput%2Fmemory%20spill%2Fdisk%20spill%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20else%20%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%20Error%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Parser-%3E%3EParser%3A%20%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A0%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20end%5Cn%20%20%20%20end%5Cn%20%20%20%20Parser--%3E%3ECaller%3A%20DagObservation(app_id%2C%20stages%2C%20logs%2C%20metadata)%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__mermaid_v3%2F5176c647dbbde1f25061b65f5baa3c2c.svg%22%2C%22collapse%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22KgDVd%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"dmIcK\" id=\"dmIcK\"><span data-lake-id=\"uab47cfb2\" id=\"uab47cfb2\">Stage 时长</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ufaf3ac27\" id=\"ufaf3ac27\"><code data-lake-id=\"u33e86b06\" id=\"u33e86b06\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0eb0d19\" id=\"ua0eb0d19\">_duration()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u769710bb\" id=\"u769710bb\"> 使用 Completion Time 减 Submission Time，任一缺失则为 0，并用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub07c1a83\" id=\"ub07c1a83\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4f40692f\" id=\"u4f40692f\">max(0, result)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4005e4a9\" id=\"u4005e4a9\"> 防止异常负值。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"KQqBw\" id=\"KQqBw\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc9ec4fb2\" id=\"uc9ec4fb2\">Task 指标累加</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uf9ca5456\" id=\"uf9ca5456\"><span data-lake-id=\"u05890dc3\" id=\"u05890dc3\">TaskEnd 事件可能先于 StageCompleted 被读到，因此两条路径都使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u240e6799\" id=\"u240e6799\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba2c4996\" id=\"uba2c4996\">setdefault()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5e24dd06\" id=\"u5e24dd06\"> 创建 StageMetric。Shuffle read 读取 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u8d3cc080\" id=\"u8d3cc080\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf378813\" id=\"ubf378813\">Remote Bytes Read</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u820d5651\" id=\"u820d5651\">，write 读取 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uc4ad370d\" id=\"uc4ad370d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub9f9c556\" id=\"ub9f9c556\">Shuffle Bytes Written</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua0cb3d63\" id=\"ua0cb3d63\">；spill 同时累加内存和磁盘字节。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"fGRc9\" id=\"fGRc9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud3a71743\" id=\"ud3a71743\">容错策略</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u7b556ac2\" id=\"u7b556ac2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u45484e78\" id=\"u45484e78\">损坏 JSON 行被跳过，而不是让整份日志解析失败。这提高了可用性，但当前没有记录“跳过了多少行”，生产环境应把解析错误计数放进 metadata 或监控指标。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"x8g2P\" id=\"x8g2P\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4bd13e5\" id=\"ue4bd13e5\">5. 诊断规则合并</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uaed5fa12\" id=\"uaed5fa12\"><code data-lake-id=\"u020de30e\" id=\"u020de30e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ube45bdea\" id=\"ube45bdea\">DagDiagnosisEngine.diagnose(user_request, observation)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u44730a3b\" id=\"u44730a3b\"> 先使用真实 observation，再使用请求语义补充风险。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"diagram\" value=\"data:%7B%22type%22%3A%22mermaid%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22flowchart%20TD%5Cn%20%20%20%20Start%5B%5C%22diagnose(request%2C%20observation)%5C%22%5D%20--%3E%20HasObs%7B%5C%22observation%20%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%3F%5C%22%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20HasObs%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E6%98%AF%5C%22%7C%20Metrics%5B%5C%22_from_observation()%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Metrics%20--%3E%20Shuffle%7B%5C%22total_shuffle%20%3E%20512%20MiB%3F%5C%22%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Shuffle%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E6%98%AF%5C%22%7C%20ShuffleFinding%5B%5C%22%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%20Shuffle%20%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%8E%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Metrics%20--%3E%20Spill%7B%5C%22%E4%BB%BB%E4%B8%80%20Stage%20spilled_bytes%20%3E%200%3F%5C%22%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Spill%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E6%98%AF%5C%22%7C%20SpillFinding%5B%5C%22%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E5%8E%8B%E5%8A%9B%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%8E%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20HasObs%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E5%90%A6%5C%22%7C%20Semantic%5Cn%20%20%20%20ShuffleFinding%20--%3E%20Semantic%5B%5C%22%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E8%AF%AD%E4%B9%89%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20SpillFinding%20--%3E%20Semantic%5Cn%20%20%20%20Semantic%20--%3E%20S1%5B%5C%22%E8%81%9A%E5%90%88%2F%E6%8E%92%E5%BA%8F%2FShuffle%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Semantic%20--%3E%20S2%5B%5C%22%E5%80%BE%E6%96%9C%2F%E7%83%AD%E7%82%B9%2F%E9%95%BF%E5%B0%BE%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Semantic%20--%3E%20S3%5B%5C%22Join%2F%E5%AE%BD%E8%A1%A8%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Semantic%20--%3E%20S4%5B%5C%22OOM%2F%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%2Fspill%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20S1%20--%3E%20Empty%7B%5C%22%E4%BB%8D%E6%97%A0%20bottleneck%3F%5C%22%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20S2%20--%3E%20Empty%5Cn%20%20%20%20S3%20--%3E%20Empty%5Cn%20%20%20%20S4%20--%3E%20Empty%5Cn%20%20%20%20Empty%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E6%98%AF%5C%22%7C%20Conservative%5B%5C%22%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%E5%85%A8%E8%A1%A8%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E4%BF%9D%E5%AE%88%E8%AF%8A%E6%96%AD%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Empty%20--%3E%7C%5C%22%E5%90%A6%5C%22%7C%20Result%5B%5C%22%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E8%AF%8A%E6%96%AD%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20Conservative%20--%3E%20Result%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__mermaid_v3%2F777266d6371bd4bb14d00912329d63bd.svg%22%2C%22collapse%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22V4Owi%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u9017d881\" id=\"u9017d881\"><span data-lake-id=\"u506ca14c\" id=\"u506ca14c\">真实指标和语义规则可能同时生成同类建议，当前没有去重。优点是证据来源完整，缺点是输出可能重复；可以按 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u6a5a2b13\" id=\"u6a5a2b13\"><span data-lake-id=\"u104d6b2b\" id=\"u104d6b2b\">type + action</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3b4c3329\" id=\"u3b4c3329\"> 聚合，并保留多个 evidence。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"hAR64\" id=\"hAR64\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4eb7adf\" id=\"ue4eb7adf\">6. 规则输出结构</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u7b5331d9\" id=\"u7b5331d9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31fcb163\" id=\"u31fcb163\">每个瓶颈包含：</span></p><table data-lake-id=\"LvyH7\" id=\"LvyH7\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 750px\"><colgroup><col width=\"375\"><col width=\"375\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"uf40728ca\" id=\"uf40728ca\"><td data-lake-id=\"u3d1e8f53\" id=\"u3d1e8f53\"><p data-lake-id=\"u5cc53432\" id=\"u5cc53432\"><span data-lake-id=\"uef0ff1e7\" id=\"uef0ff1e7\">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u94907415\" id=\"u94907415\"><p data-lake-id=\"u64686e28\" id=\"u64686e28\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7983f458\" id=\"u7983f458\">含义</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u0b2a7a9c\" id=\"u0b2a7a9c\"><td data-lake-id=\"ubba2a8f1\" id=\"ubba2a8f1\"><p data-lake-id=\"u81decb3b\" id=\"u81decb3b\"><code data-lake-id=\"u2e247741\" id=\"u2e247741\"><span data-lake-id=\"u942862ff\" id=\"u942862ff\">type</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u3764cb75\" id=\"u3764cb75\"><p data-lake-id=\"ub224f757\" id=\"ub224f757\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1a3cf864\" id=\"u1a3cf864\">shuffle、skew、join、oom 或 scan</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"uc52cc1bc\" id=\"uc52cc1bc\"><td data-lake-id=\"ue71d0f4c\" id=\"ue71d0f4c\"><p data-lake-id=\"u0080b67e\" id=\"u0080b67e\"><code data-lake-id=\"ua012dd7c\" id=\"ua012dd7c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u81c972e1\" id=\"u81c972e1\">evidence</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u3fba46dd\" id=\"u3fba46dd\"><p data-lake-id=\"u3deedd2b\" id=\"u3deedd2b\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc53cb7cc\" id=\"uc53cb7cc\">指标或请求语义证据</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u9e695ce1\" id=\"u9e695ce1\"><td data-lake-id=\"u69f88c46\" id=\"u69f88c46\"><p data-lake-id=\"u6f97e7bd\" id=\"u6f97e7bd\"><code data-lake-id=\"u8206082b\" id=\"u8206082b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1e958e16\" id=\"u1e958e16\">impact</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u4e67faaf\" id=\"u4e67faaf\"><p data-lake-id=\"u7625d874\" id=\"u7625d874\"><span data-lake-id=\"u236244c3\" id=\"u236244c3\">对网络、磁盘、长尾或失败的影响</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id=\"ufd7c30e4\" id=\"ufd7c30e4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u220e4e5d\" id=\"u220e4e5d\">每条建议包含 priority、action、reason 和 example。例如观察到 spill 时，不只建议加内存，还强调减少单 Task 状态和检查 groupByKey/cache/collect。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"KVKm2\" id=\"KVKm2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0a7e1719\" id=\"u0a7e1719\">7. 与 Spark 执行的连接</span></h2><card type=\"block\" name=\"diagram\" value=\"data:%7B%22type%22%3A%22mermaid%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sequenceDiagram%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20Tool%20as%20SparkToolExecutor%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20Prev%20as%20%E5%B7%B2%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A4%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20Observer%20as%20DagObserver%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20Engine%20as%20DagDiagnosisEngine%5Cn%20%20%20%20participant%20Disk%20as%20artifact%20%E7%9B%AE%E5%BD%95%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20Tool-%3E%3EPrev%3A%20%E6%9F%A5%E6%89%BE%E6%9C%AC%E6%AC%A1%20run%20%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E5%92%8C%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97%E7%BA%BF%E7%B4%A2%5Cn%20%20%20%20Tool-%3E%3EObserver%3A%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%A8%20DagObservation%5Cn%20%20%20%20Observer--%3E%3ETool%3A%20observation%20%E6%88%96%E7%A9%BA%5Cn%20%20%20%20Tool-%3E%3EEngine%3A%20diagnose(plan.user_request%2C%20observation)%5Cn%20%20%20%20Engine--%3E%3ETool%3A%20%E8%AF%8A%E6%96%AD%20payload%5Cn%20%20%20%20Tool-%3E%3EDisk%3A%20%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5%2007_dag_diagnosis.json%5Cn%20%20%20%20Tool--%3E%3ETool%3A%20%E6%9E%84%E9%80%A0%20AgentStepResult%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__mermaid_v3%2F72ffcdd3667df2342c505eb509213061.svg%22%2C%22collapse%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22wyExq%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub8f5f354\" id=\"ub8f5f354\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua696b590\" id=\"ua696b590\">当没有真实 observation 时，产物仍可生成，但它应被理解为静态风险检查，而非运行后结论。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"ll66K\" id=\"ll66K\"><span data-lake-id=\"u247cbb3e\" id=\"u247cbb3e\">8. 实现难点与取舍</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"LQkCF\" id=\"LQkCF\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9d75c790\" id=\"u9d75c790\">Spark 版本兼容</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u9e6a2c56\" id=\"u9e6a2c56\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf3c4ea2b\" id=\"uf3c4ea2b\">不同 Spark 版本、压缩 Event Log 和 rolling log 可能改变读取方式或字段结构。当前 parser 针对有限事件字段，需要使用多个 Spark 版本的 fixture 做契约测试，并对未知事件保持忽略。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"BIOIq\" id=\"BIOIq\"><span data-lake-id=\"u021ca257\" id=\"u021ca257\">倾斜与长尾不能只靠关键词</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"udc03630b\" id=\"udc03630b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u641586e2\" id=\"u641586e2\">当前“倾斜/热点/长尾”主要来自请求语义，尚未采集每个 Task 的 duration、input size 和 shuffle size 分布。真实检测应比较 P50/P95/P99、最大值/中位数比以及热点 partition，才能把“风险提示”升级为“观测结论”。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"o0ozc\" id=\"o0ozc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u959ffe08\" id=\"u959ffe08\">固定阈值缺少上下文</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u84ac7bdc\" id=\"u84ac7bdc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u09e418e0\" id=\"u09e418e0\">512 MiB Shuffle 对小作业可能很大，对大集群可能正常。生产阈值应按输入量、作业类型、Executor 规格和历史基线动态计算，并输出当前值与基线。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"wDsLE\" id=\"wDsLE\"><span data-lake-id=\"u89ad4d0e\" id=\"u89ad4d0e\">优化效果验证</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u0ec85819\" id=\"u0ec85819\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufdcba41c\" id=\"ufdcba41c\">建议本身不是结果。需要对同一 workload 做优化前后对照，同时验证输出行数和关键业务指标一致，再比较耗时、Shuffle、spill、失败率与资源成本。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"FH46O\" id=\"FH46O\"><span data-lake-id=\"u550826fc\" id=\"u550826fc\">9. 源码索引与验证</span></h2><ul list=\"u3f65f14a\"><li fid=\"u6886b507\" data-lake-id=\"u31b5be98\" id=\"u31b5be98\"><code data-lake-id=\"u7a529aa7\" id=\"u7a529aa7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65cf34a8\" id=\"u65cf34a8\">sparkos/infrastructure/spark/event_log_parser.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucf9f1000\" id=\"ucf9f1000\">：事件读取与聚合。</span></li><li fid=\"u6886b507\" data-lake-id=\"ub7ef6f49\" id=\"ub7ef6f49\"><code data-lake-id=\"u0af6376c\" id=\"u0af6376c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u77a5a517\" id=\"u77a5a517\">sparkos/domain/diagnosis.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3456b662\" id=\"u3456b662\">：StageMetric 与 DagObservation。</span></li><li fid=\"u6886b507\" data-lake-id=\"ucfd6fefb\" id=\"ucfd6fefb\"><code data-lake-id=\"uae9c4077\" id=\"uae9c4077\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5c4b4cec\" id=\"u5c4b4cec\">sparkos/application/dag_observer.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uebc51c7f\" id=\"uebc51c7f\">：观测入口。</span></li><li fid=\"u6886b507\" data-lake-id=\"uefbe2b16\" id=\"uefbe2b16\"><code data-lake-id=\"u072a0329\" id=\"u072a0329\"><span data-lake-id=\"u76646e29\" id=\"u76646e29\">sparkos/application/dag_diagnosis.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3e9b1c41\" id=\"u3e9b1c41\">：指标与语义规则。</span></li><li fid=\"u6886b507\" data-lake-id=\"uf11f77d0\" id=\"uf11f77d0\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc93b1a8e\" id=\"uc93b1a8e\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc45a9a08\" id=\"uc45a9a08\">sparkos/infrastructure/spark/history_server_client.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u63b4eba1\" id=\"u63b4eba1\">：History Server 客户端。</span></li><li fid=\"u6886b507\" data-lake-id=\"u0c9448c9\" id=\"u0c9448c9\"><code data-lake-id=\"u34fc0425\" id=\"u34fc0425\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf09fed5b\" id=\"uf09fed5b\">tests/test_workbench.py::test_event_log_parser_extracts_stage_metrics</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue174ff17\" id=\"ue174ff17\">：Stage 时长、Shuffle 和 spill fixture。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"ySsab\" id=\"ySsab\"><span data-lake-id=\"u21eb2154\" id=\"u21eb2154\">10. 如何向面试官概括</span></h2><blockquote data-lake-id=\"uee9e42a9\" id=\"uee9e42a9\"><p data-lake-id=\"ueacc44e1\" id=\"ueacc44e1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue916c55a\" id=\"ue916c55a\">我没有让模型直接读整份 Spark 日志，而是先把 SparkListener 事件归一成 Stage 指标，再由可解释规则生成证据和建议。当前 Shuffle 和 spill 有真实指标支撑，倾斜与长尾仍主要是风险提示；生产化会补 Task 分位数、动态基线和优化前后回归。</span></p></blockquote>",
  "empty_unpublished": false,
  "retrieved_at": "2026-10-08T16:25:13+08:00"
}